---
import StudioLayout from '../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { agency } from '../data/agency';
const founder = 'founder' in agency ? String(agency.founder) : '';
---
<StudioLayout title="About the studio — WebDECOR" active="studio" description="Meet WebDECOR, Max’s independent web design practice connecting strategy, design, and development.">
  <section class="site-wrap site-section studio-intro">
    <p class="site-kicker">The studio</p><h1 class="site-heading">Max’s independent web design practice.</h1>
    <div class="intro-grid"><p class="site-lede">{founder ? `WebDECOR is ${founder}’s independent web design practice.` : 'WebDECOR is an independent web design practice.'} Strategy, visual design, and development form one connected project.</p><div class="intro-copy"><p>The aim is simple: a website that feels like your business and helps people understand it. Character comes from purposeful choices in typography, imagery, content, and navigation.</p><p>A project starts with your audience and goals. The scope is agreed before the visual direction and pages take shape.</p><a class="site-button" href="/start/">{founder ? `Talk to ${founder}` : 'Start a conversation'}<Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-wrap site-section site-rule" aria-labelledby="approach-title"><p class="site-kicker">The approach</p><h2 id="approach-title" class="section-heading">How I approach a website.</h2><div class="approach-grid"><article><span class="site-kicker">01 / Direction</span><h3>Begin with the purpose.</h3><p>Agree on who the website is for, what it needs to communicate, and the next step a visitor should take.</p></article><article><span class="site-kicker">02 / Design</span><h3>Give it a point of view.</h3><p>Build a visual language around your identity, then carry it consistently through the pages.</p></article><article><span class="site-kicker">03 / Experience</span><h3>Make the details work.</h3><p>Consider navigation, mobile layouts, accessible controls, and how the finished site will be maintained.</p></article></div><a class="studio-link" href="/services/">Explore services and pricing <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></section>
  <section class="site-wrap site-section site-rule studio-note"><div><p class="site-kicker">About the work</p><h2 class="section-heading">What’s in the portfolio.</h2></div><div><p>The work currently shown on this site is self-initiated. FORME and OBJECT / ROOM demonstrate design thinking and interface ideas; they are concept studies rather than client commissions.</p><p>The Design Lab is a separate space for more experimental directions.</p><a class="studio-link" href="/#work">See the concept work <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
<style>
  .studio-intro .site-heading {max-width:900px}.intro-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;margin-top:40px}.intro-grid .site-lede {margin:0}.intro-copy p,.approach-grid p,.studio-note p:not(.site-kicker) {color:var(--site-muted);line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 18px}.intro-copy .site-button {margin-top:8px}.section-heading {font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:12px 0 28px}.approach-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px;margin-top:40px}.approach-grid h3 {font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable',sans-serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:18px 0 14px}.studio-link {text-decoration:underline!important;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;margin-top:12px;text-underline-offset:5px}.studio-link svg {width:16px}.studio-note {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px}.studio-note .section-heading {margin-bottom:0}
  @media(max-width:750px){.intro-grid,.studio-note {grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.intro-grid {margin-top:28px}.approach-grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:28px}.approach-grid article {padding-bottom:12px}.approach-grid h3 {margin-top:12px}.studio-note .section-heading {margin-bottom:0}}
</style>
